<title>JAPAN: Central JR to apply on June 30 for share listings.</title>
<headline>Central JR to apply on June 30 for share listings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Japan Railway Co, also known as JR Tokai, said on Tuesday that it would apply on June 30 to list its shares on the Tokyo Stock Exchange, Osaka Securities Exchange and stock exchanges in Nagoya and Kyoto.</p>
</text>
